---
// Cohort administration for the operating team: add founders, issue setup
// links, reset a forgotten password, remove someone who has left.
//
// Access is enforced server-side by /api/admin/users; the checks here only
// decide what to render.
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <title>Cohort admin · Sprint Buddy</title>
    <!--
      Global rather than scoped: the people table is built in JavaScript, and
      Astro's scoped styles only reach elements present in the template.
    -->
    <style is:global>
      :root {
        --bg: #0b0c0f;
        --panel: rgba(20, 22, 27, 0.9);
        --text: #f4f4f5;
        --muted: #9ca3af;
        /* Signal red, matching --brand-accent on the founder side. This page
           keeps its own tokens under different names, which is why the recolour
           went straight past it. */
        --accent: #e8170a;
        --ok: #6fcf97;
        --danger: #f4746a;
        --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
        --font: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
        --serif: "Source Serif 4", ui-serif, Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      html, body { margin: 0; min-height: 100%; background: var(--bg); }
      body {
        font-family: var(--font);
        color: var(--text);
        padding: 40px 24px 80px;
      }
      main { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
      h1 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 2.25rem; margin: 0 0 6px; }
      h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.375rem; margin: 0 0 14px; }
      .lede { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 32px; font-size: 0.9375rem; }
      .panel {
        background: var(--panel);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 24px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.9375rem; }
      th {
        text-align: left;
        font-size: 0.6875rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-weight: 600;
        padding: 0 10px 10px 0;
      }
      td { padding: 11px 10px 11px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); vertical-align: middle; }
      .pill {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 2px 9px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .pill.active { color: var(--ok); border-color: rgba(111, 207, 151, 0.4); }
      .pill.pending { color: #e2b93b; border-color: rgba(226, 185, 59, 0.4); }
      .pill.organizer { color: var(--accent); border-color: rgba(232, 23, 10, 0.4); }
      .row { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-end; }
      label { display: block; }
      /* The date picker is not a <label>: it wraps a button, and a label
         wrapping a button swallows the click on some browsers. */
      .field { display: block; }
      .label-text {
        display: block;
        font-size: 0.6875rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }
      input, select, textarea {
        padding: 10px 12px;
        border-radius: 9px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
        color: var(--text);
        font-family: var(--font);
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
      }
      textarea { width: 100%; min-height: 120px; resize: vertical; line-height: 1.5; }
      input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--accent); }
      /*
         Buttons are ink, not accent.
         
         This was a blanket accent fill, which was fine while the accent was
         blue. Once it became signal red, every button on the page, "Add
         deadline" and "Save" included, became a solid alarm-coloured control.
         Red is left to the two things that deserve it: the section nav's active
         pill, and destructive actions via button.ghost.danger.
      */
      button {
        padding: 10px 16px;
        border: 0;
        border-radius: 9px;
        background: var(--text);
        color: #0b0c0f;
        font-family: var(--font);
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        cursor: pointer;
      }
      button.ghost {
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--muted);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 6px 11px;
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        font-weight: 500;
      }
      button.ghost:hover { color: var(--text); border-color: var(--accent); }
      button.ghost.danger:hover { color: var(--danger); border-color: rgba(244, 116, 106, 0.5); }
      button:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: default; }
      .links { margin-top: 20px; }
      .deadline-row {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        padding: 12px 0;
      }
      .deadline-row.archived { opacity: 0.5; }
      .deadline-head {
        display: flex;
        align-items: baseline;
        gap: 12px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }
      .deadline-head strong { flex: 1 1 220px; }
      .deadline-meta { color: var(--ink-faint); font-size: 13px; }
      .deadline-count {
        font-size: 12.5px;
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        color: var(--ink-sub);
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      .deadline-count.all-done { color: var(--brand-accent); font-weight: 700; }
      .deadline-row details { margin-top: 6px; }
      .deadline-row summary {
        cursor: pointer;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: var(--ink-faint);
        min-height: 32px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
      }
      .deadline-actions { margin-top: 8px; }
      .link-item {
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 12px 14px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        display: flex;
        gap: 12px;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }
      .link-item code {
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        word-break: break-all;
        flex: 1 1 320px;
      }
      .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.8125rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 14px 0 0; }
      .message { font-size: 0.875rem; margin-top: 14px; }
      .message.error { color: var(--danger); }
      .message.ok { color: var(--ok); }
      /* ---- Broadcast ---------------------------------------------- */
      .inline { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
      .bc-tag {
        font-family: inherit;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        padding: 2px 8px;
        margin-right: 4px;
      }
      /* Scrolls rather than growing without limit: the point of the individual
         picker is to glance at it, and a list that pushes the Send button off
         the page is how the wrong people get selected. */
      .bc-people {
        max-height: 260px;
        overflow-y: auto;
        margin-top: 10px;
        display: grid;
        gap: 6px;
      }
      .bc-people label { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 0.875rem; }
      .bc-people .role { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.75rem; }
      .bc-sent { font-size: 0.875rem; padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
      .bc-sent .when { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.75rem; }
      [hidden] { display: none !important; }
      a { color: var(--accent); }
      .back-link {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        /* 44px is the smallest reliable touch target, and this is the control
           somebody reaches for when they are stuck on the wrong page. */
        min-height: 44px;
        margin: 0 0 6px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .back-link:hover { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline; }
      .back-link:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 3px; border-radius: 4px; }

      /* Tabs. One area visible at a time so the page height stays constant
         however much knowledge is loaded. */
      /* ---- Section nav ------------------------------------------------------
         A floating pill: every section is an icon, and only the open one shows
         its name, sliding out beside the icon.

         Built from the page's own tokens and CSS transitions rather than the
         supplied React component, which wanted Tailwind, shadcn's cn() and
         framer-motion. This page is Astro with a hand-written stylesheet and no
         React at all, and the whole animation is one width transition.

         Every tab keeps a title and an aria-label, because an icon is not a
         name. */
      .tabs {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 4px;
        margin: 0 0 26px;
        padding: 6px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: var(--panel);
        box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
        max-width: 100%;
        overflow-x: auto;
        scrollbar-width: none;
      }
      .tabs::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
      .tab {
        flex: 0 0 auto;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        background: transparent;
        border: none;
        color: var(--muted);
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 0 11px;
        height: 40px;
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-family: inherit;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: background-color .2s ease, color .2s ease, transform .12s ease;
      }
      .tab svg {
        width: 21px;
        height: 21px;
        flex: 0 0 auto;
        fill: none;
        stroke: currentColor;
        stroke-width: 1.9;
        stroke-linecap: round;
        stroke-linejoin: round;
      }
      .tab:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07); color: var(--text); }
      .tab:active { transform: scale(.97); }
      .tab:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; }

      /* Present on every tab and measured to zero until its tab is open, so the
         width animates rather than the text snapping in. */
      .tab-label {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 0fr;
        margin-left: 0;
        opacity: 0;
        transition: grid-template-columns .26s cubic-bezier(.2, .8, .3, 1),
                    margin-left .26s cubic-bezier(.2, .8, .3, 1),
                    opacity .16s ease;
      }
      .tab-label > span { overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; }
      .tab:hover { color: inherit; border-color: var(--border); }
      .tab[aria-selected="true"] {
        background: rgba(232, 23, 10, 0.14);
        color: var(--accent);
      }
      .tab[aria-selected="true"] .tab-label {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        margin-left: 8px;
        opacity: 1;
      }
      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        .tab, .tab-label { transition: none; }
      }

      /* Long lists scroll inside their own box rather than growing the page. */
      .scroller {
        max-height: 52vh;
        overflow-y: auto;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 4px 12px;
      }
      .rowline {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        padding: 9px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      }
      .rowline:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
      .rowline .grow {
        flex: 1;
        overflow: hidden;
        text-overflow: ellipsis;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      .disclose {
        background: transparent;
        border: none;
        color: var(--muted);
        cursor: pointer;
        font-family: inherit;
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        padding: 4px 8px;
      }
      .expanded { padding: 0 0 12px 26px; }
      .expanded textarea, .expanded input { width: 100%; }
      .flagged { color: #f7768e; font-size: 0.75rem; margin: 4px 0 0 26px; }

      /* The action bar sits above a long review list, not after it. */
      .stickybar {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 2;
        background: var(--panel);
        padding: 10px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      /* ── Date picker ──
         Ported from a supplied shadcn dropdown range picker. Single date, not
         a range: the one calendar field in this app is a deadline's due date.
         Month and year are dropdowns rather than arrow-paging, which is the
         part of that component worth having: the sprint runs into December
         and paging one month at a time to reach it is four clicks. */
      .datepicker { position: relative; }
      .dp-trigger {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        min-width: 15rem;
        min-height: 40px;
        padding: 9px 12px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: rgba(10, 11, 14, 0.7);
        color: var(--text);
        font: inherit;
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        text-align: left;
        cursor: pointer;
      }
      .dp-trigger:hover { border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.24); }
      .dp-trigger:focus-visible {
        outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
        outline-offset: 2px;
      }
      .dp-icon {
        flex: 0 0 auto;
        width: 16px;
        height: 16px;
        fill: none;
        stroke: var(--muted);
        stroke-width: 1.6;
        stroke-linecap: round;
      }
      /* Until a date is chosen the trigger is showing placeholder text, so it
         reads as muted rather than as a value. */
      .dp-trigger[data-empty="true"] .dp-value { color: var(--muted); }

      .dp-pop {
        position: absolute;
        z-index: 60;
        top: calc(100% + 6px);
        left: 0;
        width: max-content;
        padding: 14px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: #14161b;
        box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
      }
      .dp-pop[hidden] { display: none; }
      /* Near the right edge the popover would otherwise run off the page. */
      .dp-pop[data-align="right"] { left: auto; right: 0; }

      .dp-selects { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
      .dp-selects select {
        min-height: 36px;
        padding: 6px 8px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: rgba(10, 11, 14, 0.7);
        color: var(--text);
        font: inherit;
        font-size: 0.875rem;
      }
      .dp-selects select:focus-visible {
        outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
        outline-offset: 1px;
      }

      .dp-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(7, 2.25rem);
        gap: 2px;
      }
      .dp-weekday {
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        height: 1.75rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.6875rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .dp-day {
        position: relative;
        height: 2.25rem;
        border: 0;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--text);
        font: inherit;
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        cursor: pointer;
      }
      .dp-day:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); }
      .dp-day:focus-visible {
        outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
        outline-offset: -2px;
      }
      .dp-day[data-outside="true"] { color: rgba(244, 244, 245, 0.3); }
      .dp-day[data-selected="true"] {
        background: var(--accent);
        color: #fff;
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      /* Today gets a dot rather than a ring, so it never reads as selected. */
      .dp-day[data-today="true"]::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        bottom: 5px;
        left: 50%;
        width: 3px;
        height: 3px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--accent);
        transform: translateX(-50%);
      }
      .dp-day[data-today="true"][data-selected="true"]::after { background: #fff; }

      .dp-foot {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 8px;
        margin-top: 12px;
        padding-top: 10px;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      }
      .dp-foot button {
        min-height: 34px;
        padding: 6px 14px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
      }
      .dp-clear {
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--muted);
        font: inherit;
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        cursor: pointer;
      }
      .dp-clear:hover:not(:disabled) { color: var(--text); }
      .dp-clear:disabled { opacity: 0.45; cursor: default; }
      .dp-today {
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--text);
        font: inherit;
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        cursor: pointer;
      }
      .dp-today:hover { border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.24); }

    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <!-- The only way back used to be editing the URL. -->
      <a class="back-link" href="/">
        <span aria-hidden="true">&#8592;</span> Back to Sprint Buddy
      </a>
      <h1>Cohort admin</h1>
      <p class="lede" id="lede">Loading…</p>

      <div id="denied" hidden>
        <div class="panel">
          <h2>Organizers only</h2>
          <p class="note">
            This page is for the Sprint operating team. <a href="/">Go back to Sprint Buddy</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="app" hidden>
        <!-- One area at a time. Eight stacked panels plus a review list plus a
             hundred knowledge entries made this page something you scrolled
             through to find anything. The sections all stay in the DOM and are
             only shown or hidden, so the inline script below keeps working
             unchanged — every getElementById still resolves. -->
        <nav class="tabs" id="tabs" aria-label="Admin sections">
          <button type="button" class="tab" data-tab="people" aria-label="People" title="People">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.2"/><path d="M3.5 19a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 11 0"/><path d="M16 5.6a3.2 3.2 0 0 1 0 6.2"/><path d="M17.5 14.2a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 3 4.8"/></svg>
            <span class="tab-label"><span>People</span></span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="tab" data-tab="deadlines" aria-label="Deadlines" title="Deadlines">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2.5"/><path d="M3 10h18M8 3v4M16 3v4"/><path d="M12 13v3l2 1.4"/></svg>
            <span class="tab-label"><span>Deadlines</span></span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="tab" data-tab="programme" aria-label="Programme" title="Programme">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="5" cy="6.5" r="1.6"/><circle cx="5" cy="12" r="1.6"/><circle cx="5" cy="17.5" r="1.6"/><path d="M10 6.5h10M10 12h10M10 17.5h6"/></svg>
            <span class="tab-label"><span>Programme</span></span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="tab" data-tab="shared" aria-label="Shared" title="Shared">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 13.5 5.4 5.6A2 2 0 0 1 7.3 4h9.4a2 2 0 0 1 1.9 1.6L21 13.5"/><path d="M3 13.5h5l1.2 2.4h5.6L16 13.5h5v4.6A2 2 0 0 1 19 20H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-1.9z"/></svg>
            <span class="tab-label"><span>Shared</span></span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="tab" data-tab="broadcast" aria-label="Broadcast" title="Broadcast">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 9.5v5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5 1.5H8l7 4V5.5l-7 4H5.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 0 4 11z"/><path d="M18 9a4 4 0 0 1 0 6"/><path d="M8 16v3.5"/></svg>
            <span class="tab-label"><span>Broadcast</span></span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="tab" data-tab="knowledge" aria-label="Knowledge" title="Knowledge">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 6.8C10.6 5.6 8.7 5 6 5H3.5v12H6c2.7 0 4.6.6 6 1.8"/><path d="M12 6.8C13.4 5.6 15.3 5 18 5h2.5v12H18c-2.7 0-4.6.6-6 1.8z"/></svg>
            <span class="tab-label"><span>Knowledge</span></span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="tab" data-tab="transcript" aria-label="Add transcript" title="Add transcript">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 3v5h5"/><path d="M8.5 13h7M8.5 16.5h4.5"/></svg>
            <span class="tab-label"><span>Add transcript</span></span>
          </button>
        </nav>

        <div class="tabpanel" id="tab-people" hidden>
        <section class="panel">
          <h2>People</h2>
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Name</th><th>Email</th><th>Role</th><th>Status</th><th></th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody id="users"></tbody>
          </table>
        </section>

        <section class="panel">
          <h2>Add one person</h2>
          <form id="add-one" class="row">
            <label>
              <span class="label-text">Full name</span>
              <input id="add-name" required placeholder="Aino Virtanen" />
            </label>
            <label>
              <span class="label-text">Email</span>
              <input id="add-email" type="email" required placeholder="aino@example.com" />
            </label>
            <label>
              <span class="label-text">Role</span>
              <select id="add-role">
                <option value="founder">Founder</option>
                <option value="organizer">Organizer</option>
              </select>
            </label>
            <button type="submit">Add and create link</button>
          </form>
          <p class="message" id="add-message" hidden></p>
        </section>

        <section class="panel">
          <h2>Add the whole cohort</h2>
          <p class="note" style="margin-top:0">
            One person per line, as <strong>Name, email</strong>. Everyone added here is a
            founder — add the operating team individually above.
          </p>
          <form id="add-bulk">
            <textarea
              id="bulk-text"
              placeholder="Aino Virtanen, aino@example.com&#10;Elias Koskinen, elias@example.com"
            ></textarea>
            <div style="margin-top:12px"><button type="submit">Add everyone</button></div>
          </form>
          <p class="message" id="bulk-message" hidden></p>
        </section>

        <section class="panel" id="links-panel" hidden>
          <h2>Setup links sent</h2>
          <p class="note" style="margin-top:0">
            Each link is emailed straight to that person's own address. You never see it,
            and neither does anyone else on the team — a setup link is as good as a
            password, so whoever holds it can claim the account. Each works once and
            expires after 14 days. If someone says it never arrived, use
            <strong>Resend link</strong> on their row.
          </p>
          <div class="links" id="links"></div>
        </section>
        </div>

        <div class="tabpanel" id="tab-deadlines" hidden>
        <section class="panel">
          <h2>Deadlines</h2>
          <p class="note" style="margin-top:0">
            Cohort-wide milestones. Everyone sees the same list, and each founder ticks
            off their own. Archive something that happened and is over: it hides the
            row from founders and keeps who finished it. Delete is for a deadline set
            up wrong, and takes the completions with it
            and keeps the completion history.
          </p>
          <p class="note" style="margin-top:0">
            Founders who have not ticked it off are emailed three days before, two days
            before, ten hours before, and once the morning after. Ticking it off stops
            all of them. Leave the time empty for end of day; it only changes when the
            ten-hour email lands.
          </p>

          <form id="add-deadline" class="row">
            <label>
              <span class="label-text">Title</span>
              <input id="dl-title" required maxlength="200" placeholder="Lifeline pitch to the cohort" />
            </label>
            <label>
              <span class="label-text">Description (optional)</span>
              <input id="dl-description" maxlength="2000" placeholder="Five minutes, no slides" />
            </label>
            <div class="field">
              <span class="label-text" id="dl-due-label">Due date</span>
              <!-- The picker writes the ISO string into the hidden input below,
                   which keeps the id the submit handler already reads. Swapping
                   the visible control does not touch the form logic. -->
              <input id="dl-due" type="hidden" required />
              <div class="datepicker" data-datepicker data-for="dl-due">
                <button
                  type="button"
                  class="dp-trigger"
                  data-dp-trigger
                  aria-haspopup="dialog"
                  aria-expanded="false"
                  aria-labelledby="dl-due-label dl-due-value"
                >
                  <svg class="dp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                    <rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2" />
                    <path d="M3 10h18M8 3v4M16 3v4" />
                  </svg>
                  <span class="dp-value" id="dl-due-value" data-dp-value>Pick a date</span>
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <label>
              <span class="label-text">Due time (optional)</span>
              <input id="dl-time" type="time" />
            </label>
            <label>
              <span class="label-text">Sprint week (optional)</span>
              <input id="dl-week" type="number" min="1" max="15" placeholder="2" />
            </label>
            <button type="submit">Add deadline</button>
          </form>
          <p class="message" id="dl-message" hidden></p>

          <div id="deadline-list"></div>
        </section>
        </div>

        <div class="tabpanel" id="tab-programme" hidden>
        <section class="panel">
          <h2>Programme</h2>
          <p class="note" style="margin-top:0">
            What the sprint is running each week. The advisor is given the current
            week only, and is told plainly that it describes the cohort's schedule
            and not any individual founder's company. Leave a week blank and it says
            nothing about it at all — which is better than saying something stale.
          </p>

          <form id="programme-form" class="row">
            <label>
              <span class="label-text">Week</span>
              <select id="pr-week"></select>
            </label>
            <label>
              <span class="label-text">Phase</span>
              <input id="pr-phase" maxlength="200" placeholder="Trend Research" />
            </label>
            <label>
              <span class="label-text">Title</span>
              <input id="pr-title" maxlength="200" placeholder="Orientation &amp; Kick-off" />
            </label>
            <label style="flex:1 1 100%">
              <span class="label-text">Milestones — one per line</span>
              <textarea id="pr-milestones" rows="4" maxlength="4000" placeholder="Define the research framework&#10;Clarify roles and tasks"></textarea>
            </label>
            <label style="flex:1 1 100%">
              <span class="label-text">Sessions — one per line</span>
              <textarea id="pr-sessions" rows="4" maxlength="4000" placeholder="Tue 9:30–11:30 — Team meeting, intro to the sprint&#10;Wed 13:00–15:00 — Workshop"></textarea>
            </label>
            <button type="submit">Save week</button>
          </form>
          <p class="message" id="pr-message" hidden></p>

          <div id="programme-list"></div>
        </section>
        </div>

        <div class="tabpanel" id="tab-shared" hidden>
          <section class="panel">
            <h2>Shared with you</h2>
            <p class="note" style="margin-top:0">
              Conversations a founder chose to hand over. Nothing else is
              readable: everything a founder has not shared stays private to
              them, and unsharing takes it out of this list immediately.
            </p>
            <p class="note" style="margin-top:0">
              Opening one tells the founder it was read, once. They are not
              shown how often, and re-reading changes nothing — sharing
              something difficult and hearing nothing back is worse than not
              sharing at all.
            </p>
            <p class="message" id="shared-message" hidden></p>
            <div id="shared-list"></div>
          </section>
        </div>

        <div class="tabpanel" id="tab-broadcast" hidden>
          <section class="panel">
            <h2>Send a message to the cohort</h2>
            <p class="note" style="margin-top:0">
              Everyone selected gets their own email, addressed to them. Nobody
              sees anybody else's address.
            </p>
            <p class="note" style="margin-top:0">
              Type <code>{"{{first_name}}"}</code> where you want their name. The
              buttons below insert it for you. Available:
              <code>{"{{first_name}}"}</code>, <code>{"{{name}}"}</code>,
              <code>{"{{email}}"}</code>.
            </p>

            <form id="bc-form" class="row">
              <label style="flex:1 1 100%">
                <span class="label-text">Subject</span>
                <input id="bc-subject" maxlength="200" required
                       placeholder="Thursday session moved to 14:00" />
              </label>
              <label style="flex:1 1 100%">
                <span class="label-text">Message</span>
                <textarea id="bc-body" rows="12"
                          placeholder={"Hi {{first_name}},\n\n..."}></textarea>
              </label>
            </form>
            <p class="note" style="margin-top:0">
              Insert:
              <button type="button" class="bc-tag" data-tag="first_name">{"{{first_name}}"}</button>
              <button type="button" class="bc-tag" data-tag="name">{"{{name}}"}</button>
              <button type="button" class="bc-tag" data-tag="email">{"{{email}}"}</button>
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="panel">
            <h2>Who gets it</h2>
            <p class="row" style="gap:1.5rem">
              <label class="inline">
                <input type="checkbox" id="bc-role-founder" checked />
                <span>All founders</span>
              </label>
              <label class="inline">
                <input type="checkbox" id="bc-role-organizer" />
                <span>All organizers</span>
              </label>
            </p>
            <details>
              <summary>Or pick people individually</summary>
              <div id="bc-people" class="bc-people"></div>
            </details>
            <p class="message ok" id="bc-count" hidden></p>
          </section>

          <section class="panel">
            <h2>Send</h2>
            <p class="note" style="margin-top:0">
              A blast cannot be recalled. Send yourself a test first, read it in
              your own inbox, then type the number of recipients to confirm.
            </p>
            <p class="row">
              <button type="button" id="bc-test">Send a test to me</button>
              <span class="note" id="bc-test-state">Not tested yet.</span>
            </p>
            <form id="bc-send" class="row">
              <label>
                <span class="label-text">Type the recipient count to confirm</span>
                <input id="bc-confirm" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" placeholder="0" />
              </label>
              <button type="submit" id="bc-go" disabled>Send to everyone selected</button>
            </form>
            <p class="message" id="bc-message" hidden></p>
          </section>

          <section class="panel">
            <h2>Already sent</h2>
            <div id="bc-history"></div>
          </section>
        </div>

        <div class="tabpanel" id="tab-knowledge" hidden>
        <section class="panel">
          <h2>What Sprint Buddy knows</h2>
          <p class="note" style="margin-top:0">
            What the programme's mentors have said, one entry per topic. All of
            it is sent with every message — there is no search step to miss the
            right passage. Order matters: it is the order they are read in.
            Fill in the source: it is for your records and lets you archive a
            whole session in one click. It is never sent to Sprint Buddy and
            never shown to the cohort — what a mentor said in a closed room
            becomes the programme's position, not a quote with their name on it.
            Archive rather than delete so you can put something back.
          </p>
          <p class="note" id="kb-size" style="margin-top:0"></p>

          <form id="knowledge-form" class="row">
            <input type="hidden" id="kb-id" />
            <label>
              <span class="label-text">Topic</span>
              <input id="kb-topic" maxlength="120" placeholder="SELLING AND PRODUCT-MARKET FIT" />
            </label>
            <label>
              <span class="label-text">Order</span>
              <input id="kb-position" type="number" step="10" value="0" />
            </label>
            <label>
              <span class="label-text">Source (who said it)</span>
              <input id="kb-source" maxlength="120" placeholder="Mentor session, 12 Sept" />
            </label>
            <label style="flex:1 1 100%">
              <span class="label-text">What they said</span>
              <textarea id="kb-body" rows="6" maxlength="8000" placeholder="Promise a quarter when you think a month. Being early beats being precise."></textarea>
            </label>
            <button type="submit">Save entry</button>
            <button type="button" id="kb-new">New entry</button>
          </form>
          <p class="message" id="kb-message" hidden></p>

          <div id="knowledge-list"></div>
        </section>
